        <object id="N_LOC_CLIFF" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_CLIFF — at cliff&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;The forest thins out here to reveal a steep cliff.  There is no way&lt;br&gt;down, but a small ledge can be seen to the west across the chasm.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. SOUTH, FORES → LOC_FOREST17&lt;br&gt;2. EAST → LOC_FOREST19&lt;br&gt;3. JUMP → LOC_NOMAKE [Ch 11]" source_id="LOC_CLIFF" description_en="The forest thins out here to reveal a steep cliff.  There is no way&#10;down, but a small ledge can be seen to the west across the chasm." description_es="" short_en="You're at cliff." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_SURFACE" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_CLIFF" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="ABOVE=True, LIT=True, NOBACK=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_FOREST17&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_FOREST17&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;SOUTH&quot;, &quot;FORES&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_FOREST19&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_FOREST19&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;EAST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_NOMAKE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_NOMAKE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;JUMP&quot;]}]" objects_here="URN" immovable_objects_here="URN">
