        <object id="N_LOC_GRATE" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_GRATE — outside grate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are in a 20-foot depression floored with bare dirt.  Set into the&lt;br&gt;dirt is a strong steel grate mounted in concrete.  A dry streambed&lt;br&gt;leads into the depression.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. EAST, FORES → LOC_FOREST7&lt;br&gt;2. SOUTH → LOC_FOREST10&lt;br&gt;3. WEST → LOC_FOREST9&lt;br&gt;4. BUILD → LOC_START&lt;br&gt;5. UPSTR, GULLY, NORTH → LOC_SLIT&lt;br&gt;6. ENTER, INWAR, DOWN → LOC_BELOWGRATE [Ch 02] [not GRATE=GRATE_CLOSED]&lt;br&gt;7. ENTER ✕ msg GRATE_NOWAY" source_id="LOC_GRATE" description_en="You are in a 20-foot depression floored with bare dirt.  Set into the&#10;dirt is a strong steel grate mounted in concrete.  A dry streambed&#10;leads into the depression." description_es="" short_en="You're outside grate." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_SURFACE" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_GRATE" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="ABOVE=True, LIT=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_FOREST7&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_FOREST7&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;EAST&quot;, &quot;FORES&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_FOREST10&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_FOREST10&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;SOUTH&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_FOREST9&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_FOREST9&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;WEST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_START&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_START&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&qu