        <object id="N_LOC_HILL" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_HILL — at hill in road&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You have walked up a hill, still in the forest.  The road slopes back&lt;br&gt;down the other side of the hill.  There is a building in the distance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. BUILD, EAST → LOC_START&lt;br&gt;2. WEST → LOC_ROADEND&lt;br&gt;3. NORTH → LOC_FOREST20&lt;br&gt;4. SOUTH, FORES → LOC_FOREST13&lt;br&gt;5. DOWN ✕ msg WHICH_WAY" source_id="LOC_HILL" description_en="You have walked up a hill, still in the forest.  The road slopes back&#10;down the other side of the hill.  There is a building in the distance." description_es="" short_en="You're at hill in road." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_SURFACE" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_HILL" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="ABOVE=True, LIT=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_START&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_START&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;BUILD&quot;, &quot;EAST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_ROADEND&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_ROADEND&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;WEST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_FOREST20&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_FOREST20&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;NORTH&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_FOREST13&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_FOREST13&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;SOUTH&quot;, &quot;FORES&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;speak&quot;, &quot;WHICH_WAY&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;WHICH_WAY&quot;, &quot;acti