        <object id="N_LOC_LEDGE" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_LEDGE — on ledge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are on a small ledge on one face of a sheer cliff.  There are no&lt;br&gt;paths away from the ledge.  Across the chasm is a small clearing&lt;br&gt;surrounded by forest.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. JUMP → LOC_NOMAKE [Ch 11]" source_id="LOC_LEDGE" description_en="You are on a small ledge on one face of a sheer cliff.  There are no&#10;paths away from the ledge.  Across the chasm is a small clearing&#10;surrounded by forest." description_es="" short_en="You're on ledge." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_SURFACE" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_LEDGE" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="ABOVE=True, LIT=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_NOMAKE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_NOMAKE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;JUMP&quot;]}]" objects_here="SAPPH" treasures_here="SAPPH">
