        <object id="N_LOC_SLIT" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_SLIT — at slit in streambed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;At your feet all the water of the stream splashes into a 2-inch slit&lt;br&gt;in the rock.  Downstream the streambed is bare rock.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. BUILD → LOC_START&lt;br&gt;2. UPSTR, NORTH → LOC_VALLEY&lt;br&gt;3. EAST, FORES → LOC_FOREST6&lt;br&gt;4. WEST → LOC_FOREST10&lt;br&gt;5. DOWNS, BED, SOUTH, DEPRE → LOC_GRATE&lt;br&gt;6. SLIT, STREA, DOWN, INWAR, ENTER ✕ msg DONT_FIT" source_id="LOC_SLIT" description_en="At your feet all the water of the stream splashes into a 2-inch slit&#10;in the rock.  Downstream the streambed is bare rock." description_es="" short_en="You're at slit in streambed." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_SURFACE" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_SLIT" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="ABOVE=True, FLUID=True, LIT=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_START&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_START&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;BUILD&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_VALLEY&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_VALLEY&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;UPSTR&quot;, &quot;NORTH&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_FOREST6&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_FOREST6&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;EAST&quot;, &quot;FORES&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_FOREST10&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_FOREST10&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;WEST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_GRATE&quot;], &quot;ac