        <object id="N_LOC_START" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_START — in front of building&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are standing at the end of a road before a small brick building.&lt;br&gt;Around you is a forest.  A small stream flows out of the building and&lt;br&gt;down a gully.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. ROAD, WEST, UPWAR → LOC_HILL&lt;br&gt;2. ENTER, BUILD, INWAR, EAST → LOC_BUILDING&lt;br&gt;3. DOWNS, GULLY, STREA, SOUTH, DOWN → LOC_VALLEY&lt;br&gt;4. FORES, NORTH → LOC_FOREST1&lt;br&gt;5. DEPRE → LOC_GRATE" source_id="LOC_START" description_en="You are standing at the end of a road before a small brick building.&#10;Around you is a forest.  A small stream flows out of the building and&#10;down a gully." description_es="" short_en="You're in front of building." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_SURFACE" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_START" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="ABOVE=True, FLUID=True, LIT=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_HILL&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_HILL&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;ROAD&quot;, &quot;WEST&quot;, &quot;UPWAR&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BUILDING&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BUILDING&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;ENTER&quot;, &quot;BUILD&quot;, &quot;INWAR&quot;, &quot;EAST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_VALLEY&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_VALLEY&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;DOWNS&quot;, &quot;GULLY&quot;, &quot;STREA&quot;, &quot;SOUTH&quot;, &quot;DOWN&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_FOREST1&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_FOREST1&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;FORES&quot;, &quot;NORTH&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_GRATE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_GRATE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;DEPRE&quot;]}]" sound="STREAM_GURGLES">
