        <object id="N_LOC_BIRDCHAMBER" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_BIRDCHAMBER — in bird chamber&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are in a splendid chamber thirty feet high.  The walls are frozen&lt;br&gt;rivers of orange stone.  An awkward canyon and a good passage exit&lt;br&gt;from east and west sides of the chamber.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. DEPRE → LOC_GRATE [Ch 01] [not GRATE=GRATE_CLOSED]&lt;br&gt;2. ENTRA → LOC_BELOWGRATE&lt;br&gt;3. DEBRI → LOC_DEBRIS&lt;br&gt;4. CANYO, EAST → LOC_AWKWARD&lt;br&gt;5. PASSA, PIT, WEST → LOC_PITTOP" source_id="LOC_BIRDCHAMBER" description_en="You are in a splendid chamber thirty feet high.  The walls are frozen&#10;rivers of orange stone.  An awkward canyon and a good passage exit&#10;from east and west sides of the chamber." description_es="" short_en="You're in bird chamber." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_ENTRY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_BIRDCHAMBER" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_GRATE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_GRATE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: {&quot;object&quot;: &quot;GRATE&quot;, &quot;state&quot;: &quot;GRATE_CLOSED&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;not&quot;}, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;DEPRE&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BELOWGRATE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BELOWGRATE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;ENTRA&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_DEBRIS&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_DEBRIS&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;DEBRI&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_AWKWARD&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_AWKWARD&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot