        <object id="N_LOC_CRACK" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_CRACK — [unpassable crack]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;The crack is far too small for you to follow.  At its widest it is&lt;br&gt;barely wide enough to admit your foot.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. (implicit) → LOC_PITTOP" source_id="LOC_CRACK" description_en="The crack is far too small for you to follow.  At its widest it is&#10;barely wide enough to admit your foot." description_es="" short_en="" maptag="" chapter_id="CH_ENTRY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_CRACK" review_status="ok" role="transient" conditions="DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_PITTOP&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_PITTOP&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: []}]">
