        <object id="N_LOC_EASTBANK" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_EASTBANK — on east bank of fissure&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are on the east bank of a fissure slicing clear across the hall.&lt;br&gt;The mist is quite thick here, and the fissure is too wide to jump.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. HALL, EAST → LOC_MISTHALL&lt;br&gt;2. JUMP ✕ msg CROSS_BRIDGE [not FISSURE=UNBRIDGED]&lt;br&gt;3. FORWA → LOC_NOMAKE [Ch 11] [not FISSURE=BRIDGED]&lt;br&gt;4. OVER, ACROS, WEST, CROSS ✕ msg NO_CROSS [not FISSURE=BRIDGED]&lt;br&gt;5. OVER → LOC_WESTBANK" source_id="LOC_EASTBANK" description_en="You are on the east bank of a fissure slicing clear across the hall.&#10;The mist is quite thick here, and the fissure is too wide to jump." description_es="" short_en="You're on east bank of fissure." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_ENTRY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_EASTBANK" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_MISTHALL&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_MISTHALL&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;HALL&quot;, &quot;EAST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;speak&quot;, &quot;CROSS_BRIDGE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;CROSS_BRIDGE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;speak&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: {&quot;object&quot;: &quot;FISSURE&quot;, &quot;state&quot;: &quot;UNBRIDGED&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;not&quot;}, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;JUMP&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_NOMAKE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_NOMAKE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: {&quot;object&quot;: &quot;FISSURE&quot;, &quot;state&quot;: &quot;BRIDGED&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;not&quot;}, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;FORWA&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;speak&quot;, &quo