        <object id="N_LOC_EASTPIT" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_EASTPIT — in east pit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are at the bottom of the eastern pit in the Twopit Room.  There is&lt;br&gt;a small pool of oil in one corner of the pit.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. UPWAR, OUT → LOC_EASTEND" source_id="LOC_EASTPIT" description_en="You are at the bottom of the eastern pit in the Twopit Room.  There is&#10;a small pool of oil in one corner of the pit." description_es="" short_en="You're in east pit." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_CENTRAL" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_EASTPIT" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True, FLUID=True, OILY=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_EASTEND&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_EASTEND&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;UPWAR&quot;, &quot;OUT&quot;]}]">
