        <object id="N_LOC_NARROW" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_NARROW — in narrow corridor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are in a long, narrow corridor stretching out of sight to the&lt;br&gt;west.  At the eastern end is a hole through which you can see a&lt;br&gt;profusion of leaves.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. DOWN, CLIMB, EAST → LOC_WESTPIT&lt;br&gt;2. JUMP → LOC_NECKBROKE [Ch 11]&lt;br&gt;3. WEST, GIANT → LOC_GIANTROOM" source_id="LOC_NARROW" description_en="You are in a long, narrow corridor stretching out of sight to the&#10;west.  At the eastern end is a hole through which you can see a&#10;profusion of leaves." description_es="" short_en="You're in narrow corridor." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_CENTRAL" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_NARROW" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_WESTPIT&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_WESTPIT&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;DOWN&quot;, &quot;CLIMB&quot;, &quot;EAST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_NECKBROKE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_NECKBROKE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;JUMP&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_GIANTROOM&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_GIANTROOM&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;WEST&quot;, &quot;GIANT&quot;]}]">
