        <object id="N_LOC_PITBRINK" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_PITBRINK — at brink of pit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are on the brink of a thirty foot pit with a massive orange column&lt;br&gt;down one wall.  You could climb down here but you could not get back&lt;br&gt;up.  The maze continues at this level.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. DOWN, CLIMB → LOC_BIRDCHAMBER [Ch 02]&lt;br&gt;2. WEST → LOC_ALIKE10&lt;br&gt;3. SOUTH → LOC_MAZEEND6&lt;br&gt;4. NORTH → LOC_ALIKE12&lt;br&gt;5. EAST → LOC_ALIKE13" source_id="LOC_PITBRINK" description_en="You are on the brink of a thirty foot pit with a massive orange column&#10;down one wall.  You could climb down here but you could not get back&#10;up.  The maze continues at this level." description_es="" short_en="You're at brink of pit." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_MAZE_ALIKE" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_PITBRINK" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="ALLALIKE=True, DEEP=True, NOBACK=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BIRDCHAMBER&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BIRDCHAMBER&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;DOWN&quot;, &quot;CLIMB&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_ALIKE10&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_ALIKE10&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;WEST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_MAZEEND6&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_MAZEEND6&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;SOUTH&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_ALIKE12&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_ALIKE12&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;NORTH&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_ALIKE13&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_ALIKE13&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;EAST&quot;]}]">
