        <object id="N_LOC_TOPSTALACTITE" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_TOPSTALACTITE — at top of stalactite&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;A large stalactite extends from the roof and almost reaches the floor&lt;br&gt;below.  You could climb down it, and jump from it to the floor, but&lt;br&gt;having done so you would be unable to reach it to climb back up.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. NORTH → LOC_SECRET2 [Ch 05]&lt;br&gt;2. DOWN, JUMP, CLIMB → LOC_ALIKE6 [40%]&lt;br&gt;3. DOWN → LOC_ALIKE9 [50%]&lt;br&gt;4. DOWN → LOC_ALIKE4" source_id="LOC_TOPSTALACTITE" description_en="A large stalactite extends from the roof and almost reaches the floor&#10;below.  You could climb down it, and jump from it to the floor, but&#10;having done so you would be unable to reach it to climb back up." description_es="" short_en="You're at top of stalactite." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_MAZE_ALIKE" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_TOPSTALACTITE" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="ALLALIKE=True, DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_SECRET2&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_SECRET2&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;NORTH&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_ALIKE6&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_ALIKE6&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: {&quot;percent&quot;: 40, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;probability&quot;}, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;DOWN&quot;, &quot;JUMP&quot;, &quot;CLIMB&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_ALIKE9&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_ALIKE9&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: {&quot;percent&quot;: 50, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;probability&quot;}, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;DOWN&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_ALIKE4&quot