        <object id="N_LOC_BEDQUILT" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_BEDQUILT — in Bedquilt&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are in Bedquilt, a long east/west passage with holes everywhere.&lt;br&gt;To explore at random select north, south, up, or down.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. EAST → LOC_COMPLEX&lt;br&gt;2. WEST → LOC_SWISSCHEESE&lt;br&gt;3. SOUTH ✕ msg FUTILE_CRAWL [65%]&lt;br&gt;4. SLAB → LOC_SLAB&lt;br&gt;5. UPWAR ✕ msg FUTILE_CRAWL [60%]&lt;br&gt;6. UPWAR → LOC_SECRET2 [70%]&lt;br&gt;7. UPWAR → LOC_DUSTY [Ch 10]&lt;br&gt;8. NORTH ✕ msg FUTILE_CRAWL [50%]&lt;br&gt;9. NORTH → LOC_LOWROOM [75%]&lt;br&gt;10. NORTH → LOC_THREEJUNCTION&lt;br&gt;11. DOWN ✕ msg FUTILE_CRAWL [65%]&lt;br&gt;12. DOWN → LOC_ANTEROOM [Ch 09]" source_id="LOC_BEDQUILT" description_en="You are in Bedquilt, a long east/west passage with holes everywhere.&#10;To explore at random select north, south, up, or down." description_es="" short_en="You're in Bedquilt." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_BEDQUILT" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_BEDQUILT" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_COMPLEX&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_COMPLEX&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;EAST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_SWISSCHEESE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_SWISSCHEESE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;WEST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;speak&quot;, &quot;FUTILE_CRAWL&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;FUTILE_CRAWL&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;speak&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: {&quot;percent&quot;: 65, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;probability&quot;}, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;SOUTH&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_SLAB&quot;], &quo