        <object id="N_LOC_COMPLEX" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_COMPLEX — at complex junction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are at a complex junction.  A low hands and knees passage from the&lt;br&gt;north joins a higher crawl from the east to make a walking passage&lt;br&gt;going west.  There is also a large room above.  The air is damp here.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. UPWAR, CLIMB, ROOM → LOC_DUSTY [Ch 10]&lt;br&gt;2. WEST, BEDQU → LOC_BEDQUILT&lt;br&gt;3. NORTH, SHELL → LOC_SHELLROOM [Ch 06]&lt;br&gt;4. EAST → LOC_ANTEROOM [Ch 09]" source_id="LOC_COMPLEX" description_en="You are at a complex junction.  A low hands and knees passage from the&#10;north joins a higher crawl from the east to make a walking passage&#10;going west.  There is also a large room above.  The air is damp here." description_es="" short_en="You're at complex junction." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_BEDQUILT" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_COMPLEX" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_DUSTY&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_DUSTY&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;UPWAR&quot;, &quot;CLIMB&quot;, &quot;ROOM&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BEDQUILT&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BEDQUILT&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;WEST&quot;, &quot;BEDQU&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_SHELLROOM&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_SHELLROOM&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;NORTH&quot;, &quot;SHELL&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_ANTEROOM&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_ANTEROOM&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;go