        <object id="N_LOC_SECRET3" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_SECRET3 — in secret e/w canyon above tight canyon&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are in a secret canyon which here runs e/w.  It crosses over a&lt;br&gt;very tight canyon 15 feet below.  If you go down you may not be able&lt;br&gt;to get back up.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. EAST → LOC_KINGHALL [Ch 03]&lt;br&gt;2. WEST → LOC_SECRET5 [not DRAGON=DRAGON_BARS]&lt;br&gt;3. WEST → LOC_SECRET6&lt;br&gt;4. DOWN → LOC_WIDEPLACE" source_id="LOC_SECRET3" description_en="You are in a secret canyon which here runs e/w.  It crosses over a&#10;very tight canyon 15 feet below.  If you go down you may not be able&#10;to get back up." description_es="" short_en="You're in secret e/w canyon above tight canyon." maptag="Secret e/w canyon" chapter_id="CH_BEDQUILT" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_SECRET3" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_KINGHALL&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_KINGHALL&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;EAST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_SECRET5&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_SECRET5&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: {&quot;object&quot;: &quot;DRAGON&quot;, &quot;state&quot;: &quot;DRAGON_BARS&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;not&quot;}, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;WEST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_SECRET6&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_SECRET6&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;WEST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_WIDEPLACE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_WIDEPLACE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, 