        <object id="N_LOC_SLAB" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_SLAB — in Slab Room&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are in a large low circular chamber whose floor is an immense slab&lt;br&gt;fallen from the ceiling (Slab Room).  East and west there once were&lt;br&gt;large passages, but they are now filled with boulders.  Low small&lt;br&gt;passages go north and south, and the south one quickly bends west&lt;br&gt;around the boulders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. SOUTH → LOC_WESTEND [Ch 03]&lt;br&gt;2. UPWAR, CLIMB → LOC_SECRET1&lt;br&gt;3. NORTH → LOC_BEDQUILT" source_id="LOC_SLAB" description_en="You are in a large low circular chamber whose floor is an immense slab&#10;fallen from the ceiling (Slab Room).  East and west there once were&#10;large passages, but they are now filled with boulders.  Low small&#10;passages go north and south, and the south one quickly bends west&#10;around the boulders." description_es="" short_en="You're in Slab Room." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_BEDQUILT" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_SLAB" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_WESTEND&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_WESTEND&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;SOUTH&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_SECRET1&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_SECRET1&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;UPWAR&quot;, &quot;CLIMB&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BEDQUILT&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BEDQUILT&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;NORTH&quot;]}]">
