        <object id="N_LOC_TALL" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_TALL — Tall canyon&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are in a tall e/w canyon.  A low tight crawl goes 3 feet north and&lt;br&gt;seems to open up.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. EAST → LOC_WIDEPLACE&lt;br&gt;2. WEST → LOC_BOULDERS1&lt;br&gt;3. NORTH, CRAWL → LOC_SWISSCHEESE" source_id="LOC_TALL" description_en="You are in a tall e/w canyon.  A low tight crawl goes 3 feet north and&#10;seems to open up." description_es="" short_en="" maptag="Tall canyon" chapter_id="CH_BEDQUILT" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_TALL" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_WIDEPLACE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_WIDEPLACE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;EAST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BOULDERS1&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BOULDERS1&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;WEST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_SWISSCHEESE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_SWISSCHEESE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;NORTH&quot;, &quot;CRAWL&quot;]}]">
