        <object id="N_LOC_THREEJUNCTION" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_THREEJUNCTION — at junction of three secret canyons&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are in a secret canyon at a junction of three canyons, bearing&lt;br&gt;north, south, and se.  The north one is as tall as the other two&lt;br&gt;combined.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. SE → LOC_BEDQUILT&lt;br&gt;2. SOUTH → LOC_SECRET2&lt;br&gt;3. NORTH → LOC_WINDOW2 [Ch 07]" source_id="LOC_THREEJUNCTION" description_en="You are in a secret canyon at a junction of three canyons, bearing&#10;north, south, and se.  The north one is as tall as the other two&#10;combined." description_es="" short_en="You're at junction of three secret canyons." maptag="Secret canyon junction" chapter_id="CH_BEDQUILT" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_THREEJUNCTION" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BEDQUILT&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BEDQUILT&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;SE&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_SECRET2&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_SECRET2&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;SOUTH&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_WINDOW2&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_WINDOW2&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;NORTH&quot;]}]">
