        <object id="N_LOC_ALCOVE" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_ALCOVE — in alcove&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are in an alcove.  A small nw path seems to widen after a short&lt;br&gt;distance.  An extremely tight tunnel leads east.  It looks like a very&lt;br&gt;tight squeeze.  An eerie light can be seen at the other end.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. NW, CAVER → LOC_MISTY&lt;br&gt;2. EAST, PASSA ⚡ special(1)&lt;br&gt;3. EAST → LOC_PLOVER" source_id="LOC_ALCOVE" description_en="You are in an alcove.  A small nw path seems to widen after a short&#10;distance.  An extremely tight tunnel leads east.  It looks like a very&#10;tight squeeze.  An eerie light can be seen at the other end." description_es="" short_en="You're in alcove." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_ORIENTAL_PLOVER" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_ALCOVE" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_MISTY&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_MISTY&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;NW&quot;, &quot;CAVER&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;special&quot;, &quot;1&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;1&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;special&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;EAST&quot;, &quot;PASSA&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_PLOVER&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_PLOVER&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;EAST&quot;]}]">
