        <object id="N_LOC_INCLINE" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_INCLINE — at steep incline above large room&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are at the top of a steep incline above a large room.  You could&lt;br&gt;climb down here, but you would not be able to climb up.  There is a&lt;br&gt;passage leading back to the north.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. NORTH, CAVER, PASSA → LOC_WATERFALL [Ch 03]&lt;br&gt;2. DOWN, CLIMB → LOC_LOWROOM [Ch 05]" source_id="LOC_INCLINE" description_en="You are at the top of a steep incline above a large room.  You could&#10;climb down here, but you would not be able to climb up.  There is a&#10;passage leading back to the north." description_es="" short_en="You're at steep incline above large room." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_ORIENTAL_PLOVER" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_INCLINE" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_WATERFALL&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_WATERFALL&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;NORTH&quot;, &quot;CAVER&quot;, &quot;PASSA&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_LOWROOM&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_LOWROOM&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;DOWN&quot;, &quot;CLIMB&quot;]}]">
