        <object id="N_LOC_MISTY" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_MISTY — in misty cavern&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are following a wide path around the outer edge of a large cavern.&lt;br&gt;Far below, through a heavy white mist, strange splashing noises can be&lt;br&gt;heard.  The mist rises up through a fissure in the ceiling.  The path&lt;br&gt;exits to the south and west.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. SOUTH, ORIEN → LOC_ORIENTAL&lt;br&gt;2. WEST → LOC_ALCOVE" source_id="LOC_MISTY" description_en="You are following a wide path around the outer edge of a large cavern.&#10;Far below, through a heavy white mist, strange splashing noises can be&#10;heard.  The mist rises up through a fissure in the ceiling.  The path&#10;exits to the south and west." description_es="" short_en="You're in misty cavern." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_ORIENTAL_PLOVER" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_MISTY" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_ORIENTAL&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_ORIENTAL&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;SOUTH&quot;, &quot;ORIEN&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_ALCOVE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_ALCOVE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;WEST&quot;]}]" sound="NO_MEANING">
