        <object id="N_LOC_SHELLROOM" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_SHELLROOM — in Shell Room&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You&amp;#x27;re in a large room carved out of sedimentary rock.  The floor and&lt;br&gt;walls are littered with bits of shells embedded in the stone.  A&lt;br&gt;shallow passage proceeds downward, and a somewhat steeper one leads&lt;br&gt;up.  A low hands and knees passage enters from the south.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. UPWAR, HALL → LOC_ARCHED&lt;br&gt;2. DOWN → LOC_SLOPING1&lt;br&gt;3. SOUTH ✕ msg CLAM_BLOCKER [carry CLAM]&lt;br&gt;4. SOUTH ✕ msg OYSTER_BLOCKER [carry OYSTER]&lt;br&gt;5. SOUTH → LOC_COMPLEX [Ch 05]" source_id="LOC_SHELLROOM" description_en="You're in a large room carved out of sedimentary rock.  The floor and&#10;walls are littered with bits of shells embedded in the stone.  A&#10;shallow passage proceeds downward, and a somewhat steeper one leads&#10;up.  A low hands and knees passage enters from the south." description_es="" short_en="You're in Shell Room." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_ORIENTAL_PLOVER" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_SHELLROOM" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_ARCHED&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_ARCHED&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;UPWAR&quot;, &quot;HALL&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_SLOPING1&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_SLOPING1&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;DOWN&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;speak&quot;, &quot;CLAM_BLOCKER&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;CLAM_BLOCKER&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;speak&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: {&quot;object&quot;: &quot;CLAM&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;carry&quot;}, &quot;verbs&quot;: