        <object id="N_LOC_WINDOW2" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_WINDOW2 — at window on pit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You&amp;#x27;re at a low window overlooking a huge pit, which extends up out of&lt;br&gt;sight.  A floor is indistinctly visible over 50 feet below.  Traces of&lt;br&gt;white mist cover the floor of the pit, becoming thicker to the left.&lt;br&gt;Marks in the dust around the window would seem to indicate that&lt;br&gt;someone has been here recently.  Directly across the pit from you and&lt;br&gt;25 feet away there is a similar window looking into a lighted room.  A&lt;br&gt;shadowy figure can be seen there peering back at you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. WEST → LOC_THREEJUNCTION [Ch 05]&lt;br&gt;2. JUMP → LOC_NECKBROKE [Ch 11]" source_id="LOC_WINDOW2" description_en="You're at a low window overlooking a huge pit, which extends up out of&#10;sight.  A floor is indistinctly visible over 50 feet below.  Traces of&#10;white mist cover the floor of the pit, becoming thicker to the left.&#10;Marks in the dust around the window would seem to indicate that&#10;someone has been here recently.  Directly across the pit from you and&#10;25 feet away there is a similar window looking into a lighted room.  A&#10;shadowy figure can be seen there peering back at you." description_es="" short_en="You're at window on pit." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_RESERVOIR" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_WINDOW2" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_THREEJUNCTION&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_THREEJUNCTION&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;WEST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_NECKBROKE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_NECKBROKE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;JUMP&quot;]}]" objects_here="OBJ_27" immovable_objects_here="OBJ_27">
