          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="N_LOC_BREATHTAKING" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_BREATHTAKING — at breath-taking view&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are on the edge of a breath-taking view.  Far below you is an&lt;br&gt;active volcano, from which great gouts of molten lava come surging&lt;br&gt;out, cascading back down into the depths.  The glowing rock fills the&lt;br&gt;farthest reaches of the cavern with a blood-red glare, giving every-&lt;br&gt;thing an eerie, macabre appearance.  The air is filled with flickering&lt;br&gt;sparks of ash and a heavy smell of brimstone.  The walls are hot to&lt;br&gt;the touch, and the thundering of the volcano drowns out all other&lt;br&gt;sounds.  Embedded in the jagged roof far overhead are myriad twisted&lt;br&gt;formations composed of pure white alabaster, which scatter the murky&lt;br&gt;light into sinister apparitions upon the walls.  To one side is a deep&lt;br&gt;gorge, filled with a bizarre chaos of tortured rock which seems to&lt;br&gt;have been crafted by the devil himself.  An immense river of fire&lt;br&gt;crashes out from the depths of the volcano, burns its way through the&lt;br&gt;gorge, and plummets into a bottomless pit far off to your left.  To&lt;br&gt;the right, an immense geyser of blistering steam erupts continuously&lt;br&gt;from a barren island in the center of a sulfurous lake, which bubbles&lt;br&gt;ominously.  The far right wall is aflame with an incandescence of its&lt;br&gt;own, which lends an additional infernal splendor to the already&lt;br&gt;hellish scene.  A dark, foreboding passage exits to the south.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. SOUTH, PASSA, OUT → LOC_WARMWALLS&lt;br&gt;2. FORK → LOC_FORK&lt;br&gt;3. DOWN ✕ msg RIDICULOUS_ATTEMPT&lt;br&gt;4. JUMP → LOC_GRUESOME [Ch 11]" source_id="LOC_BREATHTAKING" description_en="You are on the edge of a breath-taking view.  Far below you is an&#10;active volcano, from which great gouts of molten lava come surging&#10;out, cascading back down into the depths.  The glowing rock fills the&#10;farthest reaches of the cavern with a blood-red glare, giving every-&#10;thing an eerie, macabre appearance.  The air is filled with flickering&#10;sparks of ash and a heavy smell of brimstone.  The walls are hot to&#10;the touch, and the thundering of the volcano drowns out all other&#10;sounds.  Embedded in the jagged roof far overhead are myriad twisted&#10;formations composed of pure white alabaster, which scatter the murky&#10;light into sinister apparitions upon the walls.  To one side is a deep&#10;gorge, filled with a bizarre chaos of tortured rock which seems to&#10;have been crafted by the devil himself.  An immense river of fire&#10;crashes out from the depths of the volcano, burns its way through the&#10;gorge, and plummets into a bottomless pit far off to your left.  To&#10;the right, an immense geyser of blistering steam erupts continuously&#10;from a barren island in the center of a sulfurous lake, which bubbles&#10;ominously.  The far right wall is aflame with an incandescence of its&#10;own, which lends an additional infernal splendor to the already&#10;hellish scene.  A dark, foreboding passage exits to the south." description_es="" short_en="You're at breath-taking view." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_REPOSITORY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_BREATHTAKING" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True, LIT=True, NOARRR=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_WARMWALLS&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_WARMWALLS&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;SOUTH&quot;, &quot;PASSA&quot;, &quot;OUT&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_FORK&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_FORK&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;FORK&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;speak&quot;, &quot;RIDICULOUS_ATTEMPT&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;RIDICULOUS_ATTEMPT&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;speak&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;DOWN&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_GRUESOME&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_GRUESOME&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;JUMP&quot;]}]" blocked_messages="DOWN → RIDICULOUS_ATTEMPT" objects_here="VOLCANO" immovable_objects_here="VOLCANO" sound="TOTAL_ROAR" loud="true">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;arcSize=4;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="1187" y="190" width="290" height="660" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="N_LOC_CORRIDOR" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_CORRIDOR — in corridor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You&amp;#x27;re in a long east/west corridor.  A faint rumbling noise can be&lt;br&gt;heard in the distance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. WEST → LOC_NECHASM&lt;br&gt;2. EAST, FORK → LOC_FORK&lt;br&gt;3. VIEW → LOC_BREATHTAKING&lt;br&gt;4. BARRE → LOC_BARRENFRONT" source_id="LOC_CORRIDOR" description_en="You're in a long east/west corridor.  A faint rumbling noise can be&#10;heard in the distance." description_es="" short_en="You're in corridor." maptag="e/w canyon" chapter_id="CH_REPOSITORY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_CORRIDOR" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True, NOARRR=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_NECHASM&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_NECHASM&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;WEST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_FORK&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_FORK&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;EAST&quot;, &quot;FORK&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BREATHTAKING&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BREATHTAKING&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;VIEW&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BARRENFRONT&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BARRENFRONT&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;BARRE&quot;]}]" sound="DULL_RUMBLING">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;arcSize=4;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
