        <object id="N_LOC_FORK" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_FORK — at fork in path&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;The path forks here.  The left fork leads northeast.  A dull rumbling&lt;br&gt;seems to get louder in that direction.  The right fork leads southeast&lt;br&gt;down a gentle slope.  The main corridor enters from the west.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. WEST → LOC_CORRIDOR&lt;br&gt;2. NE, LEFT → LOC_WARMWALLS&lt;br&gt;3. SE, RIGHT, DOWN → LOC_LIMESTONE&lt;br&gt;4. VIEW → LOC_BREATHTAKING&lt;br&gt;5. BARRE → LOC_BARRENFRONT" source_id="LOC_FORK" description_en="The path forks here.  The left fork leads northeast.  A dull rumbling&#10;seems to get louder in that direction.  The right fork leads southeast&#10;down a gentle slope.  The main corridor enters from the west." description_es="" short_en="You're at fork in path." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_REPOSITORY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_FORK" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True, NOARRR=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_CORRIDOR&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_CORRIDOR&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;WEST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_WARMWALLS&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_WARMWALLS&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;NE&quot;, &quot;LEFT&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_LIMESTONE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_LIMESTONE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;SE&quot;, &quot;RIGHT&quot;, &quot;DOWN&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BREATHTAKING&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BREATHTAKING&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;VIEW&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BARRENFRONT&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BARRENFRONT&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;BARRE&quot;]}]" sound="DULL_RUMBLING">
