        <object id="N_LOC_LIMESTONE" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_LIMESTONE — in limestone passage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are walking along a gently sloping north/south passage lined with&lt;br&gt;oddly shaped limestone formations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. NORTH, UPWAR, FORK → LOC_FORK&lt;br&gt;2. SOUTH, DOWN, BARRE → LOC_BARRENFRONT&lt;br&gt;3. VIEW → LOC_BREATHTAKING" source_id="LOC_LIMESTONE" description_en="You are walking along a gently sloping north/south passage lined with&#10;oddly shaped limestone formations." description_es="" short_en="You're in limestone passage." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_REPOSITORY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_LIMESTONE" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True, NOARRR=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_FORK&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_FORK&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;NORTH&quot;, &quot;UPWAR&quot;, &quot;FORK&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BARRENFRONT&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BARRENFRONT&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;SOUTH&quot;, &quot;DOWN&quot;, &quot;BARRE&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BREATHTAKING&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BREATHTAKING&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;VIEW&quot;]}]">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;arcSize=4;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="1310" y="1730" width="290" height="160" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="N_LOC_NE" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_NE — at ne end&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are at the northeast end of an immense room, even larger than the&lt;br&gt;Giant Room.  It appears to be a repository for the &amp;quot;Adventure&amp;quot;&lt;br&gt;program.  Massive torches far overhead bathe the room with smoky&lt;br&gt;yellow light.  Scattered about you can be seen a pile of bottles (all&lt;br&gt;of them empty), a nursery of young beanstalks murmuring quietly, a bed&lt;br&gt;of oysters, a bundle of black rods with rusty stars on their ends, and&lt;br&gt;a collection of brass lanterns.  Off to one side a great many dwarves&lt;br&gt;are sleeping on the floor, snoring loudly.  A notice nearby reads: &amp;quot;Do&lt;br&gt;not disturb the dwarves!&amp;quot;  An immense mirror is hanging against one&lt;br&gt;wall, and stretches to the other end of the room, where various other&lt;br&gt;sundry objects can be glimpsed dimly in the distance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. SW → LOC_SW" source_id="LOC_NE" description_en="You are at the northeast end of an immense room, even larger than the&#10;Giant Room.  It appears to be a repository for the &quot;Adventure&quot;&#10;program.  Massive torches far overhead bathe the room with smoky&#10;yellow light.  Scattered about you can be seen a pile of bottles (all&#10;of them empty), a nursery of young beanstalks murmuring quietly, a bed&#10;of oysters, a bundle of black rods with rusty stars on their ends, and&#10;a collection of brass lanterns.  Off to one side a great many dwarves&#10;are sleeping on the floor, snoring loudly.  A notice nearby reads: &quot;Do&#10;not disturb the dwarves!&quot;  An immense mirror is hanging against one&#10;wall, and stretches to the other end of the room, where various other&#10;sundry objects can be glimpsed dimly in the distance." description_es="" short_en="You're at ne end." maptag="Repository ne end" chapter_id="CH_REPOSITORY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_NE" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True, LIT=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_SW&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_SW&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;SW&quot;]}]" sound="MURMURING_SNORING">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;arcSize=4;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="2540" y="190" width="290" height="400" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="N_LOC_NECHASM" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_NECHASM — on ne side of chasm&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are on the far side of the chasm.  A ne path leads away from the&lt;br&gt;chasm on this side.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. NE → LOC_CORRIDOR&lt;br&gt;2. OVER, ACROS, CROSS, SW ✕ msg TROLL_BLOCKS [with TROLL]&lt;br&gt;3. OVER ⚡ special(3)&lt;br&gt;4. JUMP ✕ msg CROSS_BRIDGE&lt;br&gt;5. FORK → LOC_FORK&lt;br&gt;6. VIEW → LOC_BREATHTAKING&lt;br&gt;7. BARRE → LOC_BARRENFRONT" source_id="LOC_NECHASM" description_en="You are on the far side of the chasm.  A ne path leads away from the&#10;chasm on this side." description_es="" short_en="You're on ne side of chasm." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_REPOSITORY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_NECHASM" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True, NOARRR=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_CORRIDOR&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_CORRIDOR&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;NE&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;speak&quot;, &quot;TROLL_BLOCKS&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;TROLL_BLOCKS&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;speak&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: {&quot;object&quot;: &quot;TROLL&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;with&quot;}, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;OVER&quot;, &quot;ACROS&quot;, &quot;CROSS&quot;, &quot;SW&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;special&quot;, &quot;3&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;3&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;special&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;OVER&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;speak&quot;, &quot;CROSS_BRIDGE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;CROSS_BRIDGE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;speak&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;JUMP&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_FORK&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_FORK&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;FORK&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BREATHTAKING&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BREATHTAKING&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;VIEW&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BARRENFRONT&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BARRENFRONT&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;BARRE&quot;]}]" blocked_messages="OVER, ACROS, CROSS, SW → TROLL_BLOCKS [with TROLL] | JUMP → CROSS_BRIDGE" objects_here="CHASM, TROLL" immovable_objects_here="CHASM, TROLL">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;arcSize=4;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="80" y="1086" width="290" height="230" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="N_LOC_SW" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_SW — at sw end&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are at the southwest end of the repository.  To one side is a pit&lt;br&gt;full of fierce green snakes.  On the other side is a row of small&lt;br&gt;wicker cages, each of which contains a little sulking bird.  In one&lt;br&gt;corner is a bundle of black rods with rusty marks on their ends.  A&lt;br&gt;large number of velvet pillows are scattered about on the floor.  A&lt;br&gt;vast mirror stretches off to the northeast.  At your feet is a large&lt;br&gt;steel grate, next to which is a sign that reads, &amp;quot;Treasure Vault.&lt;br&gt;Keys in main office.&amp;quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. NE → LOC_NE&lt;br&gt;2. DOWN ✕ msg GRATE_NOWAY" source_id="LOC_SW" description_en="You are at the southwest end of the repository.  To one side is a pit&#10;full of fierce green snakes.  On the other side is a row of small&#10;wicker cages, each of which contains a little sulking bird.  In one&#10;corner is a bundle of black rods with rusty marks on their ends.  A&#10;large number of velvet pillows are scattered about on the floor.  A&#10;vast mirror stretches off to the northeast.  At your feet is a large&#10;steel grate, next to which is a sign that reads, &quot;Treasure Vault.&#10;Keys in main office.&quot;" description_es="" short_en="You're at sw end." maptag="Repository sw end" chapter_id="CH_REPOSITORY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_SW" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True, LIT=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_NE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_NE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;NE&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;speak&quot;, &quot;GRATE_NOWAY&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;GRATE_NOWAY&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;speak&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;DOWN&quot;]}]" blocked_messages="DOWN → GRATE_NOWAY" sound="SNAKES_HISSING">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;arcSize=4;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="2130" y="740" width="290" height="320" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="N_LOC_SWCHASM" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_SWCHASM — on sw side of chasm&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are on one side of a large, deep chasm.  A heavy white mist rising&lt;br&gt;up from below obscures all view of the far side.  A sw path leads away&lt;br&gt;from the chasm into a winding corridor.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. SW → LOC_WINDING&lt;br&gt;2. OVER, ACROS, CROSS, NE ✕ msg TROLL_BLOCKS [with TROLL]&lt;br&gt;3. OVER ✕ msg BRIDGE_GONE [not CHASM=TROLL_BRIDGE]&lt;br&gt;4. OVER ⚡ special(3)&lt;br&gt;5. JUMP → LOC_NOMAKE [Ch 11] [not CHASM=TROLL_BRIDGE]&lt;br&gt;6. JUMP ✕ msg CROSS_BRIDGE" source_id="LOC_SWCHASM" description_en="You are on one side of a large, deep chasm.  A heavy white mist rising&#10;up from below obscures all view of the far side.  A sw path leads away&#10;from the chasm into a winding corridor." description_es="" short_en="You're on sw side of chasm." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_REPOSITORY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_SWCHASM" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_WINDING&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_WINDING&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;SW&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;speak&quot;, &quot;TROLL_BLOCKS&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;TROLL_BLOCKS&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;speak&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: {&quot;object&quot;: &quot;TROLL&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;with&quot;}, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;OVER&quot;, &quot;ACROS&quot;, &quot;CROSS&quot;, &quot;NE&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;speak&quot;, &quot;BRIDGE_GONE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;BRIDGE_GONE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;speak&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: {&quot;object&quot;: &quot;CHASM&quot;, &quot;state&quot;: &quot;TROLL_BRIDGE&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;not&quot;}, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;OVER&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;special&quot;, &quot;3&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;3&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;special&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;OVER&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_NOMAKE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_NOMAKE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: {&quot;object&quot;: &quot;CHASM&quot;, &quot;state&quot;: &quot;TROLL_BRIDGE&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;not&quot;}, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;JUMP&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;speak&quot;, &quot;CROSS_BRIDGE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;CROSS_BRIDGE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;speak&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;JUMP&quot;]}]" blocked_messages="OVER, ACROS, CROSS, NE → TROLL_BLOCKS [with TROLL] | OVER → BRIDGE_GONE [not CHASM=TROLL_BRIDGE] | JUMP → CROSS_BRIDGE" objects_here="CHASM, TROLL" immovable_objects_here="CHASM, TROLL">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;arcSize=4;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="2540" y="740" width="290" height="270" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="N_LOC_WARMWALLS" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_WARMWALLS — at junction with warm walls&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;The walls are quite warm here.  From the north can be heard a steady&lt;br&gt;roar, so loud that the entire cave seems to be trembling.  Another&lt;br&gt;passage leads south, and a low crawl goes east.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. SOUTH, FORK → LOC_FORK&lt;br&gt;2. NORTH, VIEW → LOC_BREATHTAKING&lt;br&gt;3. EAST, CRAWL → LOC_BOULDERS2" source_id="LOC_WARMWALLS" description_en="The walls are quite warm here.  From the north can be heard a steady&#10;roar, so loud that the entire cave seems to be trembling.  Another&#10;passage leads south, and a low crawl goes east." description_es="" short_en="You're at junction with warm walls." maptag="Warm junction" chapter_id="CH_REPOSITORY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_WARMWALLS" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True, NOARRR=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_FORK&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_FORK&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;SOUTH&quot;, &quot;FORK&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BREATHTAKING&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BREATHTAKING&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;NORTH&quot;, &quot;VIEW&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BOULDERS2&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BOULDERS2&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;EAST&quot;, &quot;CRAWL&quot;]}]" sound="LOUD_ROAR">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;arcSize=4;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
