        <object id="N_LOC_ANTEROOM" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_ANTEROOM — in anteroom&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are in an anteroom leading to a large passage to the east.  Small&lt;br&gt;passages go west and up.  The remnants of recent digging are evident.&lt;br&gt;A sign in midair here says &amp;quot;Cave under construction beyond this point.&lt;br&gt;Proceed at own risk.  [Witt Construction Company]&amp;quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. UPWAR → LOC_COMPLEX [Ch 05]&lt;br&gt;2. WEST → LOC_BEDQUILT [Ch 05]&lt;br&gt;3. EAST → LOC_WITTSEND" source_id="LOC_ANTEROOM" description_en="You are in an anteroom leading to a large passage to the east.  Small&#10;passages go west and up.  The remnants of recent digging are evident.&#10;A sign in midair here says &quot;Cave under construction beyond this point.&#10;Proceed at own risk.  [Witt Construction Company]&quot;" description_es="" short_en="You're in anteroom." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_WITT_DIFFERENT" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_ANTEROOM" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_COMPLEX&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_COMPLEX&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;UPWAR&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_BEDQUILT&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_BEDQUILT&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;WEST&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_WITTSEND&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_WITTSEND&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;EAST&quot;]}]" objects_here="MAGAZINE, SIGN" immovable_objects_here="SIGN">
