        <object id="N_LOC_SMALLPIT" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_SMALLPIT — at bottom of pit with stream&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are in the bottom of a small pit with a little stream, which&lt;br&gt;enters and exits through tiny slits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. CLIMB, UPWAR, OUT → LOC_SMALLPITBRINK&lt;br&gt;2. SLIT, STREA, DOWN, UPSTR, DOWNS, ENTER, INWAR ✕ msg DONT_FIT" source_id="LOC_SMALLPIT" description_en="You are in the bottom of a small pit with a little stream, which&#10;enters and exits through tiny slits." description_es="" short_en="You're at bottom of pit with stream." maptag="Small pit bottom" chapter_id="CH_Y2_WINDOWS" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_SMALLPIT" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True, FLUID=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_SMALLPITBRINK&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_SMALLPITBRINK&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;CLIMB&quot;, &quot;UPWAR&quot;, &quot;OUT&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;speak&quot;, &quot;DONT_FIT&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;DONT_FIT&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;speak&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;SLIT&quot;, &quot;STREA&quot;, &quot;DOWN&quot;, &quot;UPSTR&quot;, &quot;DOWNS&quot;, &quot;ENTER&quot;, &quot;INWAR&quot;]}]" blocked_messages="SLIT, STREA, DOWN, UPSTR, DOWNS, ENTER, INWAR → DONT_FIT" sound="STREAM_GURGLES">
