        <object id="N_LOC_Y2" label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_Y2 — at &amp;quot;Y2&amp;quot;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;You are in a large room, with a passage to the south, a passage to the&lt;br&gt;west, and a wall of broken rock to the east.  There is a large &amp;quot;Y2&amp;quot; on&lt;br&gt;a rock in the room&amp;#x27;s center.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source precedence order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. PLUGH → LOC_FOOF4 [Ch 01]&lt;br&gt;2. SOUTH → LOC_FLOORHOLE [Ch 03]&lt;br&gt;3. EAST, WALL, BROKE → LOC_JUMBLE&lt;br&gt;4. WEST → LOC_WINDOW1&lt;br&gt;5. PLOVE ⚡ special(2) [carry EMERALD]&lt;br&gt;6. PLOVE → LOC_FOOF5 [Ch 06]" source_id="LOC_Y2" description_en="You are in a large room, with a passage to the south, a passage to the&#10;west, and a wall of broken rock to the east.  There is a large &quot;Y2&quot; on&#10;a rock in the room's center." description_es="" short_en="You're at &quot;Y2&quot;." maptag="Y2." chapter_id="CH_Y2_WINDOWS" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_Y2" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" travel_rules="[{&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_FOOF4&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_FOOF4&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;PLUGH&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_FLOORHOLE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_FLOORHOLE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;SOUTH&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_JUMBLE&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_JUMBLE&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null, &quot;verbs&quot;: [&quot;EAST&quot;, &quot;WALL&quot;, &quot;BROKE&quot;]}, {&quot;action_full&quot;: [&quot;goto&quot;, &quot;LOC_WINDOW1&quot;], &quot;action_target&quot;: &quot;LOC_WINDOW1&quot;, &quot;action_type&quot;: &quot;goto&quot;, &quot;cond&quot;: null